          "content": "Operations with Integers"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.088,
            0.846,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": "The position of the elevator after 60 minutes is 180 metres below the ground level."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.137,
            0.744,
            0.159
          ],
          "content": "Find the solution to part (b) using Method 1 described above."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.162,
            0.501,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": "Solution to part (b) using Method 2:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.389,
            0.187,
            0.607,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": "Starting Position = 15."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.206,
            0.846,
            0.243
          ],
          "content": "Distance Travelled = The elevator moves down at the speed of 3 metres per minute for 45 minutes, that is, (45 × (–3)). So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.244,
            0.471,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": "Ending Position = 15 + (45 × (–3)) = 15 + (–(45×3)) = 15 + (–135) = (–120)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.326,
            0.641,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": "The elevator will be 120 metres below the ground."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
